<p class="x_MsoNormal">Hello Everyone, I hope you are all doing well,</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">If you are receiving this email, then I have you down for Hosting here at Honeyman State Park for March of 2025.&nbsp; I will be sending another email in a few days that will go over the Orientation times for March and will also have a projected
 schedule attached.&nbsp; If you have any questions about what site you are headed to or if you need any host supplies such as a Sign, Nametag or vest please contact me so I can get those ordered.&nbsp; &nbsp;Hope to see you all soon for March!</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
